stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Commissioned : mint(batchId) / manufacturer identity required
    Commissioned --> InTransit : transferCustody(distributor)
    InTransit --> InTransit : transferCustody(next org)
    InTransit --> AtPharmacy : transferCustody(retailer)
    AtPharmacy --> Dispensed : markDispensed()
    Dispensed --> [*]

    Commissioned --> Recalled : flagRecall(batchId)
    InTransit --> Recalled : flagRecall(batchId)
    AtPharmacy --> Recalled : flagRecall(batchId)
    Dispensed --> Recalled : flagRecall(batchId)
    Recalled --> [*]

    AtPharmacy --> Suspended : cloneConfirmed()
    Dispensed --> Suspended : cloneConfirmed()
    Suspended --> AtPharmacy : cleared(investigation)
    Suspended --> Recalled : confirmed(investigation)

    note right of Dispensed
      A scan after Dispensed is not
      an error - patients re-check.
      Many scans from many devices is.
    end note
    note right of Suspended
      Set by the Anomaly Agent,
      not the manufacturer. The only
      system-initiated transition.
    end note
